# MilkFlint4

- Board: GL-BE14000. Images: `*glinet_gl-be14000*.bin` under mediatek/filogic.
- Bump versions via `milkflint/diffconfig` + `docs/RELEASE-*.md` + tag `vX.Y.Z`.
- Do not add CI on every main docs push; firmware workflow is tag/dispatch only.
- UI changes: run `pnpm check` in `milkflint/ui` when feasible; install Playwright Chromium first.
- Prefer Context.dev + Context7 + Supermemory over guessing OpenWrt or frontend APIs.
- MilkFlint Sim (x86 QEMU UI/appliance tests): `docs/SIM-VM.md`, `./scripts/milkflint-sim`.
